name: MyOS Correlated Customer Payment Instruction
type: MyOS/MyOS Expiry-Aware Customer Payment Instruction
description: Reusable Order PI template with a typed native obligation correlation slot. The slot may be absent
  only in the abstract template; every actual correlated PI bootstrap requires all four fields. Financial operations and
  expiry handling retain the exact expiry-aware bootstrap family. Host bootstrap must validate this
  source against the authoritative Order requirement and reserve that requirement before admission.
paymentPreparation:
  type: MyOSPaymentMandates/Payment Preparation Correlation
